From: shahed <jamshidalinezhadian@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 01:28:55 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] ims: find the P-CSCF on the ISIM or over the IMS network

Older Samsung RILs (Exynos7885 with a Shannon 327 modem) bring the IMS
PDN up but leave the data call's P-CSCF list empty and only pass it to
Samsung's own IMS daemon, so registration never started.

When LinkProperties has no P-CSCF, try the ISIM's EF P-CSCF records
first, then the 3GPP IMS domain looked up on the IMS network itself
(its DNS is often only reachable over the IMS APN), and only then the
old default-network lookup and persist.ims.pcscf_fallback.
---
